          <p>
            So the practical rule is short. If you want the classic 70 pint portable, buy a current 50 pint unit like the Frigidaire or Honeywell portables below; they are the same size class as the old 70s. If you want something genuinely larger, you are buying a crawl space or whole-house class machine rated at 70 pints or more at AHAM conditions, and paying several times as much for it. Our <a href="/best-50-pint-dehumidifier/">best 50 pint dehumidifiers</a> guide covers the portable side in depth.
          </p>
